{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign","imports":["lean:module:Init"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.n6_target_mixed_sign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.n6_target_mixed_sign","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L149-L154","doc":"Sanity: the `n = 6` target is genuinely mixed-sign (a `+` and a `-` block),\nso the failures above are failures against a real chirality pattern, not an\nall-one target. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.n6_literalT3_fails_at_2211_and_21111","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.n6_literalT3_fails_at_2211_and_21111","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L142-L147","doc":"The two other `n = 6` failures, at the height-4/5 columns\n`(2,2,1,1) ↝ λ'=(4,2)` and `(2,1,1,1,1) ↝ λ'=(5,1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.n6_literalT3_fails_at_3111","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.n6_literalT3_fails_at_3111","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L132-L140","doc":"**`(3,1,1,1) ⊢ 6`: literal `T₃` disagrees with the target.**  Its conjugate\nis `(4,1,1)` — a height-`4` column — so the target reads\n`crossingCountParity 4 = +1` while the literal `T₃` reads\n`netWritheSign 4 = -1`.  Concretely `literalT3Sign = -1 ≠ +1 = targetSign`.\nThis is the decisive Lean-checked negative: the derived `T₃` writhe-sign\ndoes **not** reproduce the mixed-sign `Δ_λ` pattern. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.n3_target_values","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.n3_target_values","kind":"theorem","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L124-L128","doc":"The `n = 3` target itself is mixed-sign `1+/2-` (matching the prune):\n`(3) ↦ +1`, `(2,1) ↦ -1`, `(1,1,1) ↦ -1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.n3_literalT3_reproduces_target","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.n3_literalT3_reproduces_target","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L115-L122","doc":"For all three partitions of `3`, the literal-`T₃` aggregation equals the\ntarget `Δ_λ` sign.  A genuine `3/3` match — but coincidental, since every\ncolumn height is `≤ 3` (where the two statistics agree, `lowHeightsAgree`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.lowHeightsAgree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.lowHeightsAgree","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L106-L111","doc":"The statistics **agree** at heights `1,2,3` (why `n = 3` matches). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.heightFourStatisticsDisagree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.heightFourStatisticsDisagree","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L96-L104","doc":"**At a column of height 4 the two sign statistics disagree.**  The\ncrossing-count parity is `(-1)^6 = +1`; the net-writhe sign is `-1`.  This\nis the concrete reason the literal `T₃` grading cannot be the `Δ_λ` sign:\n`Δ_λ` reads a crossing-COUNT parity, `T₃` reads a net-orientation sign, and\nthey differ exactly when `C(c,2)` is even (`c ≡ 0,1 mod 4`, first at `c=4`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.literalT3Sign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.literalT3Sign","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L90-L92","doc":"Literal-`T₃` aggregation: product of the per-column net-writhe signs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.targetSign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.targetSign","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L86-L88","doc":"Target `Δ_λ` chirality sign `sgn(w₀^{S_{λ'}}) = ∏_j (-1)^{C(c_j,2)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.colHeights","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.colHeights","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L80-L84","doc":"Column heights of a partition `λ` (rows, weakly decreasing) = its conjugate\n`λ'`.  `colHeights λ j = #{ rows longer than j }`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.netWritheSign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.netWritheSign","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L75-L78","doc":"**Net-writhe SIGN** of a column of height `c`: the *literal* `T₃` datum\n`sign(κ)`.  The column is a negative half-twist (net writhe `-C(c,2)`), so\nthe sign is `-1` for `c ≥ 2` and `+1` for `c ≤ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.crossingCountParity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.crossingCountParity","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L70-L73","doc":"**Crossing-COUNT parity** of a column of height `c`: `(-1)^{C(c,2)}`.\nThis is the sign-character / Slater-determinant factor; its product over\nthe columns is `sgn(w₀^{S_{λ'}})`, the `Δ_λ` chirality sign. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.cross2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.cross2","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L66-L68","doc":"Number of crossings in the half-twist antisymmetrizer of `c` strands,\n`C(c,2) = c(c-1)/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.parityFactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.T3WritheVsDeltaLambda.parityFactor","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/T3WritheVsDeltaLambdaSign.lean#L63-L64","doc":"Sign of `(-1)^k`, computed via parity (no `Monoid.npow` needed). ","signatureChunk":0}]}